# Schema geo

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class County {
        fips String
        name String
        population Integer
        density Float
        rank Integer
        active Boolean
        founded Date
        updated_at Timestamp
        guid UUID
        embedding Vector
        tags List
    }
```

## Types

### County

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `fips` | `String[5, 5]` | primary |  |
| `name` | `String[1, _]` | required |  |
| `population` | `Integer[0, _]` | required |  |
| `density` | `Float[0, 100000]` |  |  |
| `rank` | `Integer[_, 99]` |  |  |
| `active` | `Boolean` | required |  |
| `founded` | `Date` |  |  |
| `updated_at` | `Timestamp` |  |  |
| `guid` | `UUID` |  |  |
| `embedding` | `Vector[3]` |  |  |
| `tags` | `List<String>[1, 5]` |  |  |
